{"speciesId":608,"names":{"fr":"Mélancolux","es":"Lampent","en":"Lampent","ja":"ランプラー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon craint pour être de mauvais augure. Il erre dans les villes à la recherche d’âmes de défunts."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"This ominous Pokémon is feared. Through cities it wanders, searching for the spirits of the fallen."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il apparaît au moment du trépas et aspire l’âme à l’instant même où elle quitte le corps."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It arrives near the moment of death and steals spirit from the body."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The spirits it absorbs fuel its baleful fire. It hangs around hospitals waiting for people to pass on."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The spirits it absorbs fuel its baleful fire. It hangs around hospitals waiting for people to pass on."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il aspire les âmes pour entretenir sa flamme. Il erre dans les hôpitaux dans l’attente d’un trépas."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Al absorber almas, su llama se enciende. Espera a que la gente fallezca, así que suele deambular por los hospitales."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The spirits it absorbs fuel its baleful fire. It hangs around hospitals waiting for people to pass on."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"魂を 吸いとり 火を灯す。 人が 死ぬのを 待つため 病院を うろつくようになった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il apparaît au moment du trépas et aspire l’âme à l’instant même où elle quitte le corps."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Aparece hacia el final de la vida y absorbe el alma en cuanto esta se separa del cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It arrives near the moment of death and steals spirit from the body."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"臨終の 際に 現れて 魂が 肉体を 離れると すかさず 吸い取ってしまうのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il aspire les âmes pour entretenir sa flamme. Il erre dans les hôpitaux dans l’attente d’un trépas."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Al absorber almas, su llama se enciende. Espera a que la gente fallezca, así que suele deambular por los hospitales."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The spirits it absorbs fuel its baleful fire. It hangs around hospitals waiting for people to pass on."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"魂を 吸いとり 火を灯す。 人が 死ぬのを 待つため 病院を うろつくようになった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il apparaît au moment du trépas et aspire l’âme à l’instant même où elle quitte le corps."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Aparece hacia el final de la vida y absorbe el alma en cuanto esta se separa del cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It arrives near the moment of death and steals spirit from the body."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"臨終の 際に 現れて 魂が 肉体を 離れると すかさず 吸い取ってしまうのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Comme il apparaît dès qu’une personne est sur le point de trépasser, les gens le craignent et le prennent pour un messager de la mort."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Es considerado y temido como Pokémon de mal agüero, ya que aparece en los instantes previos al fallecimiento de alguien."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon appears just before someone passes away, so it’s feared as an emissary of death."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"誰かが 死ぬ 直前に 現れる ことから 死神の使い として 恐れられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se cache en ville en se faisant passer pour un lampadaire. Lorsqu’il repère une personne dont l’heure est proche, il la suit en catimini."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se oculta en entornos urbanos haciéndose pasar por una lámpara corriente. Si se topa con alguien moribundo, lo sigue en silencio."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It lurks in cities, pretending